---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import WhatsAppIcon from '../../components/WhatsAppIcon.astro';
import { CONTACT_INFO } from '../../data/products';
---

<Layout
  title="Shooter Eligibility & Indian Arms Act Compliance | ArmXchange"
  description="Understanding 0.177 calibre sporting air weapon regulations under the Indian Arms Rules 2016, Renowned Shooter certification, and GST tax guidelines."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 88px; max-width: 900px;">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 500;">Home</a> 
      <span style="color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 0.75rem;">/</span>
      <span style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Legal & Eligibility</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <span class="tech-badge">STATUTORY COMPLIANCE</span>
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">
          MINISTRY OF HOME AFFAIRS FRAMEWORK
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em;">
        Shooter Eligibility, Arms Rules 2016 & GST Guidelines
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-body);">
        ArmXchange operates in strict compliance with the statutory laws of the Republic of India governing target sports equipment. Below is the regulatory framework governing all platform listings.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: #475569; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          PROVISION 01 //
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 700;">
          Classification Under Indian Arms Rules 2016 (.177 Calibre Target Air Weapons)
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Under the Arms Rules 2016 issued by the Ministry of Home Affairs (MHA), Government of India:
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink); flex-shrink: 0;">&bull;</span>
            <span><strong>Bore & Calibre:</strong> All match rifles and air pistols listed on ArmXchange are strictly <strong>0.177 calibre (4.5 mm)</strong> bore.</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink); flex-shrink: 0;">&bull;</span>
            <span><strong>Kinetic Energy Ceiling:</strong> Olympic 10m target rifles generate between 7.0 and 7.5 Joules of muzzle kinetic energy, well beneath the statutory <strong>20 Joules threshold</strong> that triggers firearm licensing requirements under Category III(f).</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink); flex-shrink: 0;">&bull;</span>
            <span><strong>Dedicated Sporting Purpose:</strong> These instruments are precision athletic apparatus designed strictly for ISSF and NRAI target competitions.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: #475569; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          PROVISION 02 //
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 700;">
          Renowned Shooter Certification & 18% GST Application
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Under Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs (CBIC) notifications:
        </p>
        <div style="background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <div style="color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;">
            Statutory Pricing & GST Notice on New Weapon Imports:
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--color-text-body); line-height: 1.6;">
            <em>&ldquo;Further 18% GST shall be applicable for non-renowned shooters.&rdquo;</em><br />
            Athletes holding an official "Renowned Shooter" certification issued by the National Rifle Association of India (NRAI) qualify for customs duty and GST concessions on imported brand-new sporting weapons. Athletes without this formal certification are legally required to bear the prevailing 18% GST on the import value of new weapons. Pre-owned equipment transfers and domestic accessories do not carry this import GST.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: #475569; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          PROVISION 03 //
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 700;">
          Athlete Verification Standards Prior to Equipment Handover
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          To ensure target sports equipment is transferred exclusively to bona fide athletes, our team verifies the following documentation during the direct consultation stage:
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-signal-green); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Government-issued photo identification (Aadhaar, Passport, or Driving Licence).</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-signal-green); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Proof of Shooting Club Membership, State Rifle Association Affiliation, or NRAI Shooter ID.</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-signal-green); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>For Junior athletes under 18 years of age: Written parental or coach consent declaration.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 16px;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Have specific legal or import questions? Connect directly with our team.
        </p>
        <a 
          href={`https://wa.me/${CONTACT_INFO.phoneRaw}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hi Pranatpal, I have an eligibility/legal question regarding equipment transfer on ArmXchange.')}`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-whatsapp-solid"
          style="padding: 13px 26px; font-size: 0.95rem; gap: 9px;"
        >
          <WhatsAppIcon size={19} />
          <span>Consult With Pranatpal Singh</span>
          <span class="btn-trailing-icon">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
